Hyphenation patterns in pagebara-typeset
=====================================

The files in crates/typeset/data/hyph are the hyph-utf8 pattern lists
(hyph-<tag>.pat.txt) and exception lists (hyph-<tag>.hyp.txt), unmodified, from
https://github.com/hyphenation/tex-hyphen, directory
hyph-utf8/tex/generic/hyph-utf8/patterns/txt, revision
5684c0f51c0b81133db2efbe60a408b4155a3ff5 (2026-02-24). They are compiled into
the program (compressed). Each language's copyright and licence, as given in the
header of its hyph-<tag>.tex file, follows. Where a file is offered under a
choice of licences, pagebara uses it under the one named here.

The US English patterns (crates/typeset/data/hyphen-en-us.tex) are plain TeX's
hyphen.tex by Donald E. Knuth and Frank M. Liang; see THIRD-PARTY.md.


